<title>USA: St. Mary Parish CSD 1, La., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>St. Mary Parish CSD 1, La., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>said it won $16.500 million of St. Mary Parish CSD 1, La.,</p>
<p>general obligation school bonds, Series 1997, with a net</p>
<p>interest cost of 5.3864 percent.</p>
</text>
